Make.mk -   Utility program Makefile fragment that includes the blob
            programs.

listblob.c -    Utility program to list the contents of a user blob.
                Creates a header file named "userids.h" which contains
                CPP symbols identifying the position of each user
                program in the blob. This header can be included in
                any file that needs to locate a program (e.g., any
                user program that needs to exec() a specific child
                program).

mkblob.c -      Utility program to create a user blob. Also creates the
                initial index to the blob, to allow the kernel to find
                the ELF file containing the specific user program.
